  "Welcome to the New Campaign Trail!": "ui.welcome_to_the_new_campaign_trail",
  "Hello, and welcome to the New Campaign Trail! This is an updated version of The Campaign Trail (hence the name). What does TNCT bring that TCT doesn't? A number of new features, not limited to:": "ui.hello_and_welcome_to_the_new_campaign_trail_this_is_an_updated_version_of_the_campaign_trail_hence_the_name_what_does_tnct_bring_that_tct_doesn_t_a_number_of_new_features_not_limited_to",
  "A mod loader/library, allowing many of the mods made by our fabulous community to be played/compiled": "ui.a_mod_loader_library_allowing_many_of_the_mods_made_by_our_fabulous_community_to_be_played_compiled",
